{'symbol': 'NCLH', 'date': '2023-05-01 07:30:00', 'title': 'NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2023 FINANCIAL RESULTS', 'text': 'MIAMI, MAY 01, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS LTD. (NYSE: NCLH) (TOGETHER WITH NCL CORPORATION LTD., “NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS”, “NORWEGIAN” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2023 AND PROVIDED GUIDANCE FOR THE SECOND QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2023.'}{'symbol': 'NCLH', 'date': '2023-05-01 07:28:00', 'title': 'OCEANIA CRUISES TAKES DELIVERY OF AND ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP TEAM FOR NEWEST SHIP VISTA', 'text': "MIAMI , MAY 1, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- OCEANIA CRUISES ,\xa0THE WORLD'S LEADING CULINARY- AND DESTINATION-FOCUSED CRUISE LINE, HAS WELCOMED ITS NEWEST SHIP – VISTA. DELIVERED AT FINCANTIERI'S SHIPYARD IN GENOA, ITALY, OCEANIA CRUISES' INITIAL ALLURA CLASS SHIP FEATURES SEVERAL FIRSTS IN THE REALMS OF DINING, ACCOMMODATION AND GUEST EXPERIENCE."}